  "Outgoing duel invites ({n})": "Outgoing duel invites ({n})",
  "Pick a pool to review cards with spaced repetition. The system will show difficult cards more often and mastered cards less often.": "Pick a pool to review cards with spaced repetition. The system will show difficult cards more often and mastered cards less often.",
  "Pick a pool to simulate an exam. You will finish the whole session first and only then see the full review.": "Pick a pool to simulate an exam. You will finish the whole session first and only then see the full review.",
  "Pick a pool to start Training. You will get direct feedback after each answer, and required enforced pools may lock the optional ones until you finish them once.": "Pick a pool to start Training. You will get direct feedback after each answer, and required enforced pools may lock the optional ones until you finish them once.",
  "Pool: {pool}": "Pool: {pool}",
  "Pools & Fragen": "Pools & Questions",
  "Practice": "Practice",
  "Private": "Private",
  "Problemzonen (Trouble Spots) ist die Remediation-Ansicht. Sie sammelt Fragen, die dir aktuell Schwierigkeiten machen, damit du schwache Punkte direkt angehen kannst, ohne die gesamte Queue durchzulaufen.": "Trouble spots is the remediation view. It collects questions that are currently giving you trouble so you can tackle weak points directly, without working through the whole queue.",
  "Profile saved": "Profile saved",
  "Prüfung": "Exam",
  "Prüfung beenden schließt den aktuellen Versuch ab und speichert das Ergebnis basierend auf dem bisher Beantworteten. Abbrechen verwirft den Versuch stattdessen — es wird kein reguläres Ergebnis gespeichert.": "Finish exam closes the current attempt and saves the result based on what you have answered so far. Cancel discards the attempt instead — no regular result is stored.",
  "Public": "Public",
  "Punkte hängen von Korrektheit und Geschwindigkeit ab. Die schnellste richtige Antwort erhält den vollen Bonus, langsamere richtige Antworten weniger. Falsche Antworten geben keine Punkte.": "Points depend on correctness and speed. The fastest correct answer gets the full bonus, slower correct answers get less. Wrong answers score nothing.",
  "Question context active": "Question context active",
  "Quick setup": "Quick setup",
  "Quick suggestions": "Quick suggestions",
  "Read aloud": "Read aloud",
  "Ready": "Ready",
  "Refresh": "Refresh",
  "Report error": "Report error",
  "Richtige Antworten zählen zuerst. Wenn beide Spieler eine Frage korrekt beantworten, entscheidet die Geschwindigkeit über den höheren Bonus. Nach jeder Frage aktualisiert sich die Punkteleiste — du kannst das Duell live kippen sehen.": "Correct answers count first. If both players answer a question correctly, speed decides who gets the higher bonus. The score bar updates after every question — you can watch the duel swing live.",
  "Richtige Antworten zählen — bei Gleichstand entscheidet die Geschwindigkeit über den höheren Bonus.": "Correct answers count — in case of a tie, speed determines the higher bonus.",
  "Runde {round} von {total} — los geht's!": "Round {round} of {total} — let's go!",
