  "Skip — that is enough": "Skip — that is enough",
  "Smart Queue für tägliches Lernen, Training zum Üben, Prüfungsmodus für den Ernstfall.": "Smart Queue for daily review, Training for practice, Exam mode for the real thing.",
  "Smart repetition adapts cards to how difficult they felt for you.": "Smart repetition adapts cards to how difficult they felt for you.",
  "So weiß ich wo ich mehr erklären muss und wo ich direkt zum Punkt kommen kann.": "This way I know where I need to explain more and where I can get straight to the point.",
  "Sobald nur noch 2 Spieler übrig sind, beginnt der Sudden Death — da gibt es keine Leben mehr.": "Once only 2 players remain, Sudden Death begins — there are no more lives.",
  "Sofortiges Feedback, Fragetypen, MC/WF-Toggle und der schnellste Weg zum Üben.": "Immediate feedback, question types, MC/TF toggle and the fastest way to practice.",
  "Solo": "Solo",
  "Something went wrong. Please try again later.": "Something went wrong. Please try again later.",
  "Sorry, no answer available.": "Sorry, no answer available.",
  "Sources": "Sources",
  "Spaced Repetition, Boxen, fällige Karten und Problemzonen.": "Spaced repetition, boxes, due cards and trouble spots.",
  "Sprint": "Sprint",
  "Start learning": "Start learning",
  "Starte mit 3 Leben. Jede falsche Antwort kostet ein Leben. Bei 2 verbleibenden Spielern beginnt der Sudden Death — wer zuerst falsch antwortet, scheidet aus.": "Start with 3 lives. Every wrong answer costs a life. Once 2 players remain, Sudden Death begins — whoever answers wrong first is out.",
  "Strengths": "Strengths",
  "Strengths and weaknesses are only used locally by VirtuProf. They are not shared with other users or instructors.": "Strengths and weaknesses are only used locally by VirtuProf. They are not shared with other users or instructors.",
  "Strong": "Strong",
  "Student": "Student",
  "Student — general learning": "Student — general learning",
  "Subject": "Subject",
  "Sudden Death tritt ein, wenn nur noch 2 Spieler übrig sind. Ab diesem Punkt scheidet aus, wer als Erste oder Erster eine falsche Antwort gibt — Leben spielen keine Rolle mehr. Der verbleibende Spieler gewinnt die Runde.": "Sudden Death occurs when only 2 players remain. From this point, whoever gives a wrong answer first is eliminated — lives no longer matter. The remaining player wins the round.",
  "Support ticket sent": "Support ticket sent",
  "Swipe-Gesten im Training": "Swipe gestures in Training",
  "Target certification": "Target certification",
  "Target date": "Target date",
  "Technical problem": "Technical problem",
  "That one was rough. Tip: review your weakest questions in Leitner Box 1 first and then try the exam again.": "That one was rough. Tip: review your weakest questions in Leitner Box 1 first and then try the exam again.",
  "The leaderboard compares learners in the same course. XP, mastery and other activity indicators show who is currently ahead.": "The leaderboard compares learners in the same course. XP, mastery and other activity indicators show who is currently ahead.",
  "The league is course-specific. Challenge classmates, collect points and watch the standings change after each finished duel.": "The league is course-specific. Challenge classmates, collect points and watch the standings change after each finished duel.",
  "These fields are completely optional and only visible to VirtuProf.": "These fields are completely optional and only visible to VirtuProf.",
  "This area": "This area",
  "This area shows your own progress in the course, including mastery and answered questions. Use it to see where you still have gaps.": "This area shows your own progress in the course, including mastery and answered questions. Use it to see where you still have gaps.",
  "This duel is ready. Open it from here and play it inside the course duel tab.": "This duel is ready. Open it from here and play it inside the course duel tab.",
  "Too many requests. Please wait a moment before asking again.": "Too many requests. Please wait a moment before asking again.",
  "Top questions for this area": "Top questions for this area",
  "Training": "Training",
  "Training in {course}": "Training in {course}",
  "Training ist der entspannte Übungsmodus. Du beantwortest eine Frage nach der anderen und bekommst sofort Feedback. Du kannst den Pool beliebig oft wiederholen — ideal zum Einüben, Kennenlernen und ersten Durcharbeiten eines Themas.": "Training is the relaxed practice mode. You answer one question after another and get immediate feedback. You can repeat the pool as often as you like — ideal for drilling, getting familiar and working through a topic for the first time.",
  "Training kann Einfachauswahl, Mehrfachauswahl, Freitextfragen und PBQs enthalten. Bei Mehrfachauswahl müssen alle richtigen Optionen gewählt werden, Freitextfragen werden mit einer Musterlösung verglichen und PBQs nutzen eine interaktive Aufgabenkomponente.": "Training can contain single choice, multiple choice, free text questions and PBQs. Multiple choice requires all correct options to be selected, free text answers are compared against a model answer, and PBQs use an interactive task component.",
  "Training: {pool}": "Training: {pool}",
  "Tägliche Herausforderung, Benachrichtigungen und verwandte Toggles steuern, wie viel zusätzliche Orientierungshilfe oder Erinnerungsverhalten du bekommst. Sie schreiben deine eigentlichen Fragendaten nicht um, können aber ändern, wie die App dich hinweist und informiert.": "Daily challenge, notifications and related toggles control how much extra guidance or reminder behaviour you get. They do not rewrite your actual question data, but they can change how the app nudges and informs you.",
  "UI-Sprache vs. Inhaltssprache": "UI language vs. content language",
  "Unterschied zwischen Prüfung beenden und Abbrechen?": "Difference between finishing and aborting an exam?",
  "Usage question": "Usage question",
  "User-Verwaltung": "User management",
  "Verwalte Accounts, Rollen und Berechtigungen für alle Teilnehmer.": "Manage accounts, roles and permissions for all participants.",
  "VirtuProf": "VirtuProf",
