  "slide:instructor:analytics:text": "Progress table, heatmap of toughest questions, and class profile with aggregated data.\n\nYou see trends — not individual learning profiles. CSV export available.",
  "slide:instructor:analytics:title": "Analytics & Reports",
  "slide:instructor:courses:text": "Create courses and enroll participants. Each course gets its own question pools, learning modes and rules.\n\nYou decide which modes are available (Training, Leitner, Exam, Arena).",
  "slide:instructor:courses:title": "Create Courses",
  "slide:instructor:dashboard:text": "Your overview: how many courses, participants and pools do you have? Which courses are active?\n\nFrom here you navigate quickly to any course.",
  "slide:instructor:dashboard:title": "Tableau de bord",
  "slide:instructor:exams:text": "Schedule exam slots with time windows, post announcements, and manage error reports.\n\nExam mode: no feedback until the end, just like a real exam.",
  "slide:instructor:exams:title": "Exams & Announcements",
  "slide:instructor:members:text": "Enroll participants, assign roles and keep track.\n\nYou see who is actively learning and who might be falling behind.",
  "slide:instructor:members:title": "Participant Management",
  "slide:instructor:pools:text": "Create questions manually, import via CSV/JSON, or let AI generate them.\n\nPools can be assigned to multiple courses. Rules control which questions appear in which context.",
  "slide:instructor:pools:title": "Question Pools",
  "slide:instructor:settings:text": "Global settings: AI features, gamification, exam limits, tool activation.\n\nEach participant also has personal settings for language and VirtuProf.",
  "slide:instructor:settings:title": "Paramètres",
  "slide:instructor:tools:text": "Interactive simulators for subnetting, DNS, firewalls and more — for you and your participants.\n\nYou control in settings which tools are enabled.",
  "slide:instructor:tools:title": "Network Tools",
  "slide:instructor:welcome:text": "DevCloud is your learning platform. Here you create courses, manage question pools and keep track of your participants.\n\nLet us quickly walk through what is available.",
  "slide:instructor:welcome:title": "Welcome to DevCloud",
  "slide:student:arena:text": "Duel against others, sprint against time, or elimination — wrong answer and you are out.\n\nLearning becomes competition. You can also play adventure campaigns.",
  "slide:student:arena:title": "Arène",
  "slide:student:courses:text": "Your instructor sets up courses with question pools. You only see courses you are enrolled in.\n\nEach course has its own learning modes, a leaderboard and your personal progress.",
  "slide:student:courses:title": "Cours",
  "slide:student:fsrs:text": "Your cards adapt to you. Hard cards come back more often, easy cards less often.\n\nThe more honestly you rate them, the less time you waste on cards you already know.",
  "slide:student:fsrs:title": "Smart Repetition",
  "slide:student:leitner:text": "Flashcards with 5 boxes — hard questions come back more often, easy ones less. The system remembers what you know and what you need to practice.\n\nThe more regularly you study, the faster cards move up.",
  "slide:student:leitner:title": "Leitner System",
  "slide:student:progress:text": "Streaks, XP, levels and learning stats — you always see where you stand.\n\nYour instructor sees only aggregated course data, not your individual profile.",
  "slide:student:progress:title": "Your Progress",
  "slide:student:tools:text": "Interactive simulators for subnetting, DNS, firewalls, routing and more.\n\nNo dry reading — try things out and see what happens immediately.",
  "slide:student:tools:title": "Network Tools",
  "slide:student:training:text": "Quick quiz with random questions. You get instant feedback on every answer.\n\nPerfect for warming up or when you have little time.",
  "slide:student:training:title": "Entraînement",
  "slide:student:virtuprof:text": "VirtuProf sits in the sidebar on the right. It can explain topics, give tips and answer questions.\n\nThe more it knows about you, the better it can help.",
  "slide:student:virtuprof:title": "VirtuProf — your learning assistant",
  "slide:student:welcome:text": "DevCloud is your personal place to learn. Here you find courses, exercises and tools — all in one place.\n\nLet us quickly walk through what awaits you.",
  "slide:student:welcome:title": "Welcome to your learning space",
